<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Persists the current week layout as a named template (preset) for
future reuse, including optional exception overrides.</p>

<span id="example-requests-POSTapi-admin-menu-plannings">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request POST \
